---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Bio"
  description="About Stanley L — sports and events photographer based in Australia."
>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <h1 class="text-xs tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-white/30 mb-12">Bio</h1>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-white/70 leading-relaxed text-base font-light">
      <p>
        Before settling in Australia, Stanley has established himself as one of the rising sports
        photographers in Hong Kong. But his skills and expertise go far beyond just sports photography.
        Over the years, he has also developed a reputation for his professional ability to capture
        high-quality images at business and corporate events.
      </p>

      <p>
        Graduated from journalism school of the Chinese University of Hong Kong, Stanley has a talent
        for capturing the perfect moment and a deep understanding of lighting, composition, and most
        importantly, visual storytelling. He is the go-to photographer for clients who demand the best.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12">
      <a
        href="https://www.instagram.com/stanleylvisual/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-white/50 hover:text-white transition-colors border border-white/15 hover:border-white/40 px-5 py-2.5"
      >
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
